%% Authenticated mutation sequence
%% Evidence date: 2026-11-02
%% Baseline: e5d7c89a73718f35e7accbae7933af36c366bbc1
sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant Middleware as authMiddleware
  participant Verify as verify.server
  participant Handler as Domain server function
  participant Authz as authorization.server
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Browser->>Middleware: Server function request
  Middleware->>Middleware: assertSameSiteRequest()
  Middleware->>Verify: requireUserId(session/bearer)
  Verify-->>Middleware: verified userId
  Middleware->>Handler: context.userId
  Handler->>Authz: authorizeMutation(userId, permission, tenant/branch?)
  Authz->>DB: active membership + role + branch scope
  DB-->>Authz: membership/access result
  Authz-->>Handler: authorized context or error
  Handler->>DB: tenant/branch-scoped query or mutation
  DB-->>Handler: result
  Handler-->>Browser: typed response
